cruel the world can be even to a child, and takes steps to watch over them even when absent. She may spend a Willpower point to extend the Contract's effects until sunrise or sunset, so long as the child does not spend a scene without the comfort object.<br /> \u2022 <b>Wizened:</b> The Wizened is familiar with the sentimental values that one's comfort object has, as it is not too different from how he falls back to his talent for solace. He gains an Exceptional Success at three successes instead of five.<br /> <br /> <b>Catch:</b> The child was in possession of the comfort object for a period of a month, or the object was given by a lost parent or loved one.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b><u>Real and False Self</u></b> <b>(\u2022)</b><br /> <br /> <br /> <b><u>Heartwarming Comfort</u> (\u2022\u2022)<br /> <br /> <br /> <u>Transference</u> (\u2022\u2022\u2022)<br /> <br /> <br /> <u>Objective Idealism</u> (\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022)<br /> <br /> <br /> <u>Clarity of the Good</u> (\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022)</b></div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for the tag! And I'm very flattered.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-18T09:27:41-08:00","id":1018832,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hm8453a</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/833785-contracts-2e-conversions?p=1018831#post1018831\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Thanks for the tag! And I'm very flattered.</div> </div> </div> </div>You're welcome. I've been meaning to get some work on this for a while, now. And with me having graduated and job hunting, I got a little more time to do that. That said, you made these Contracts specifically to target children, right? Should I keep them as such when I'm working on the conversions? Or would some/most/all of them be applicable to older characters if you have the right Seeming clause?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}